</section>
<div class="oods-dashboard-grid">
<section class="oods-panel oods-kpi" style="grid-column:1/span 3;grid-row:1/span 1" aria-label="Total Revenue"><h3 class="oods-kpi-title">Total Revenue</h3><p class="oods-kpi-value">390</p><p class="oods-kpi-delta oods-trend-increasing">+90 (increasing)</p><p class="oods-visually-hidden">Total Revenue: 390 (increasing, delta 90).</p></section>
